  "language": "zh",
  "segments": [
    {
      "sid": "S00001",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 2.04,
      "text": "当狗第一次露出獠牙的时候"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00002",
      "start": 2.04,
      "end": 2.9,
      "text": "你没有制止它"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00003",
      "start": 2.9,
      "end": 5.46,
      "text": "后面就是露獠牙的机会就会很多很多"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00004",
      "start": 5.46,
      "end": 6.84,
      "text": "盖里就会上涨很多"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00005",
      "start": 6.84,
      "end": 11.46,
      "text": "但是如果它第一次露出獠牙"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00006",
      "start": 11.46,
      "end": 13.02,
      "text": "它正准备咬你的时候"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00007",
      "start": 13.02,
      "end": 13.74,
      "text": "你给它一巴掌"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00008",
      "start": 13.74,
      "end": 14.78,
      "text": "后面你就会发现"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00009",
      "start": 14.78,
      "end": 17.06,
      "text": "它的眼神瞬间变得清澈了很多"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00010",
      "start": 17.06,
      "end": 19.0,
      "text": "所以说人有的时候欺负你"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00011",
      "start": 19.0,
      "end": 20.52,
      "text": "一定是你示弱了"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00012",
      "start": 20.52,
      "end": 21.92,
      "text": "它才敢欺负你"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00013",
      "start": 21.92,
      "end": 23.22,
      "text": "这个示弱不是说"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00014",
      "start": 23.22,
      "end": 25.18,
      "text": "这个示弱不是说嘴上示弱"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00015",
      "start": 25.18,
      "end": 26.4,
      "text": "很多时候就是"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00016",
      "start": 26.4,
      "end": 27.58,
      "text": "你跟女神约会的时候"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00017",
      "start": 27.58,
      "end": 29.78,
      "text": "你跟她见到的第一秒对视"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00018",
      "start": 29.78,
      "end": 31.14,
      "text": "你的眼神闪躲了"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00019",
      "start": 31.14,
      "end": 32.16,
      "text": "从这一刻开始"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00020",
      "start": 32.16,
      "end": 34.26,
      "text": "你就已经被她拿捏了"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00021",
      "start": 34.26,
      "end": 35.24,
      "text": "能懂吗"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00022",
      "start": 35.24,
      "end": 37.28,
      "text": "有的时候我跟女神约会的时候"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00023",
      "start": 37.28,
      "end": 38.64,
      "text": "她一句话都不说"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00024",
      "start": 38.64,
      "end": 39.38,
      "text": "我会问她"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00025",
      "start": 39.38,
      "end": 40.38,
      "text": "我说你怎么了"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00026",
      "start": 40.38,
      "end": 42.0,
      "text": "我感觉你不太在状态"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00027",
      "start": 42.0,
      "end": 43.56,
      "text": "你是不开心吗"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00028",
      "start": 43.56,
      "end": 46.14,
      "text": "那如果那个女的说"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00029",
      "start": 46.14,
      "end": 47.44,
      "text": "我跟谁都这样"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00030",
      "start": 47.44,
      "end": 48.74,
      "text": "我说要不你先回去吧"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00031",
      "start": 48.74,
      "end": 51.86,
      "text": "我觉得这样子没有办法进行交流"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00032",
      "start": 51.86,
      "end": 53.78,
      "text": "我不喜欢这样"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00033",
      "start": 53.78,
      "end": 54.8,
      "text": "我直接告诉她"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00034",
      "start": 54.8,
      "end": 56.86,
      "text": "怎么样的基调才很好"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00035",
      "start": 56.86,
      "end": 58.62,
      "text": "不要客气"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00036",
      "start": 58.62,
      "end": 60.24,
      "text": "不要有官方感"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00037",
      "start": 60.24,
      "end": 61.0,
      "text": "其实不错了"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00038",
      "start": 61.0,
      "end": 64.58,
      "text": "很多时候你得就是不害怕失去"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00039",
      "start": 64.58,
      "end": 65.74,
      "text": "你才能得到"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00040",
      "start": 65.74,
      "end": 67.4,
      "text": "如果你害怕了"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00041",
      "start": 67.4,
      "end": 68.44,
      "text": "你就不可能得到了"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00042",
      "start": 68.44,
      "end": 69.54,
      "text": "能懂吗"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00043",
      "start": 69.54,
      "end": 72.5,
      "text": "你得真正做到无欲则刚"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00044",
      "start": 72.5,
      "end": 74.8,
      "text": "无欲则刚"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00045",
      "start": 74.8,
      "end": 76.1,
      "text": "我发现很多兄弟们"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00046",
      "start": 76.1,
      "end": 77.0,
      "text": "你们在生活中"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00047",
      "start": 77.0,
      "end": 79.66,
      "text": "把女人放的位置太重要了"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00048",
      "start": 79.66,
      "end": 82.02,
      "text": "你们把女人看得太重要了"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00049",
      "start": 82.02,
      "end": 82.78,
      "text": "正因为你们"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00050",
      "start": 82.78,
      "end": 84.42,
      "text": "就把女人看得太重要了"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00051",
      "start": 84.42,
      "end": 85.72,
      "text": "所以说你们才会有需求感"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00052",
      "start": 85.72,
      "end": 90.46,
      "text": "我觉得一个人他们在生活中是有很多很好玩的事情可以去做的"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00053",
      "start": 90.46,
      "end": 92.78,
      "text": "所以有很多好玩的事情可以去做的"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00054",
      "start": 92.78,
      "end": 95.74,
      "text": "是有很多美丽的事物可以去体验的"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00055",
      "start": 95.74,
      "end": 97.42,
      "text": "美好的事物可以去体验的"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00056",
      "start": 97.42,
      "end": 100.06,
      "text": "你们为什么总是就是拘泥于"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00057",
      "start": 100.06,
      "end": 101.54,
      "text": "这个女生不回我消息"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00058",
      "start": 101.54,
      "end": 102.88,
      "text": "哎呀那个女人不爱我"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00059",
      "start": 102.88,
      "end": 104.0,
      "text": "这个女人怎么怎么样"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00060",
      "start": 104.0,
      "end": 106.16,
      "text": "一天到晚为情所困"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00061",
      "start": 106.16,
      "end": 107.74,
      "text": "然后呢"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00062",
      "start": 107.74,
      "end": 110.08,
      "text": "深怕这个女生就是不理你"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00063",
      "start": 110.08,
      "end": 112.62,
      "text": "深怕这一场约会又失败了"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00064",
      "start": 112.62,
      "end": 116.52,
      "text": "你们并不懂得什么叫真正的就是没什么大不了"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00065",
      "start": 116.52,
      "end": 117.4,
      "text": "什么叫不在乎"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00066",
      "start": 117.4,
      "end": 119.5,
      "text": "当你真的不怕失败的时候"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00067",
      "start": 119.5,
      "end": 120.86,
      "text": "你反而容易成功"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00068",
      "start": 120.86,
      "end": 122.2,
      "text": "不要怕失去"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00069",
      "start": 122.2,
      "end": 123.9,
      "text": "很多时候我们得到一个女生"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00070",
      "start": 123.9,
      "end": 125.76,
      "text": "就是冒着失去她的风险得到的"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00071",
      "start": 125.76,
      "end": 127.1,
      "text": "如果你怕她"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00072",
      "start": 127.1,
      "end": 129.12,
      "text": "那我前面我说的那些话"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00073",
      "start": 129.12,
      "end": 130.18,
      "text": "你一句都说不出来"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00074",
      "start": 130.18,
      "end": 130.98,
      "text": "比如说我说"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00075",
      "start": 130.98,
      "end": 133.9,
      "text": "呃有的时候女生让我不舒服"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00076",
      "start": 133.9,
      "end": 134.62,
      "text": "会直接让她走"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00077",
      "start": 134.62,
      "end": 135.16,
      "text": "好"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00078",
      "start": 135.16,
      "end": 136.84,
      "text": "我说要不你先回去吧"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00079",
      "start": 136.84,
      "end": 138.0,
      "text": "这一句很简单的话"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00080",
      "start": 138.0,
      "end": 139.24,
      "text": "但是呢"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00081",
      "start": 139.24,
      "end": 141.34,
      "text": "你因为你怕这个女生"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00082",
      "start": 141.34,
      "end": 142.34,
      "text": "我Mighty我不怕"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00083",
      "start": 142.34,
      "end": 143.1,
      "text": "我可以说出来"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00084",
      "start": 143.1,
      "end": 143.76,
      "text": "你就说不出来"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00085",
      "start": 143.76,
      "end": 144.74,
      "text": "因为你怕失去"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00086",
      "start": 144.74,
      "end": 145.42,
      "text": "我不怕失去"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00087",
      "start": 145.42,
      "end": 146.48,
      "text": "那最后呢"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00088",
      "start": 146.48,
      "end": 148.04,
      "text": "这个女生就一直不尊重你"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00089",
      "start": 148.04,
      "end": 149.06,
      "text": "最后呢"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00090",
      "start": 149.06,
      "end": 149.62,
      "text": "我现在的女生就已经乱到这个女生"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00091",
      "start": 149.62,
      "end": 150.28,
      "text": "我一直没有在买的"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00092",
      "start": 150.28,
      "end": 150.84,
      "text": "我下面的女生就已经被这小女生"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00093",
      "start": 150.84,
      "end": 154.32,
      "text": "别比我更多着"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00094",
      "start": 154.32,
      "end": 155.3,
      "text": "就不出来"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00095",
      "start": 155.3,
      "end": 155.72,
      "text": "不出来"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00096",
      "start": 155.72,
      "end": 156.28,
      "text": "不出来"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00097",
      "start": 156.28,
      "end": 156.62,
      "text": "我不敢"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00098",
      "start": 156.62,
      "end": 156.94,
      "text": "我那也不当然"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00099",
      "start": 156.94,
      "end": 157.72,
      "text": "对"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00100",
      "start": 157.72,
      "end": 158.18,
      "text": "不出来"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00101",
      "start": 158.18,
      "end": 158.64,
      "text": "不出来"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00102",
      "start": 158.64,
      "end": 160.48,
      "text": "我很大"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00103",
      "start": 160.48,
      "end": 161.02,
      "text": "那啊"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00104",
      "start": 161.02,
      "end": 162.6,
      "text": "我现在的女生就这么做"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00105",
      "start": 162.6,
      "end": 163.58,
      "text": "。。。。。"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00106",
      "start": 163.58,
      "end": 164.52,
      "text": "新鸣子"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00107",
      "start": 164.52,
      "end": 164.96,
      "text": "啊"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00108",
      "start": 164.96,
      "end": 165.82,
      "text": "鸣子"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00109",
      "start": 165.82,
      "end": 166.82,
      "text": "顺"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00110",
      "start": 166.82,
      "end": 168.02,
      "text": "那"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00111",
      "start": 168.56,
      "end": 169.26,
      "text": "你"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00112",
      "start": 169.84,
      "end": 170.52,
      "text": "啊"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00113",
      "start": 170.52,
      "end": 172.34,
      "text": "这"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00114",
      "start": 172.34,
      "end": 173.68,
      "text": "我不气"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00115",
      "start": 173.68,
      "end": 174.5,
      "text": "这"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00116",
      "start": 174.5,
      "end": 175.64,
      "text": "你"
    },
    {
      "sid": "S00117",
      "start": 175.64,
      "end": 177.56,
      "text": "我们"
    }
  ]
}
